#: kcmdesignerfields.cpp:313
#, qt-format
msgid ""
"<qt><p>This section allows you to add your own GUI  Elements ('<i>Widgets</"
"i>') to store your own values into %1. Proceed as described below:</"
"p><ol><li>Click on '<i>Edit with Qt Designer</i>'<li>In the dialog, select "
"'<i>Widget</i>', then click <i>OK</i><li>Add your widgets to the "
"form<li>Save the file in the directory proposed by Qt Designer<li>Close Qt "
"Designer</ol><p>In case you already have a designer file (*.ui) located "
"somewhere on your hard disk, simply choose '<i>Import Page</i>'</"
"p><p><b>Important:</b> The name of each input widget you place within the "
"form must start with '<i>X_</i>'; so if you want the widget to correspond to "
"your custom entry '<i>X-Foo</i>', set the widget's <i>name</i> property to "
"'<i>X_Foo</i>'.</p><p><b>Important:</b> The widget will edit custom fields "
"with an application name of %2.  To change the application name to be "
"edited, set the widget name in Qt Designer.</p></qt>"
msgstr ""
"<qt><p>यो खण्डले तपाईँको मान %1 मा भण्डारण गर्नलाई तपाईँको जीयूआई तत्व('<i>विजेट</"
"i>') मा थप्न अनुमति दिन्छ । तल वर्णन गरे अनुरूप अगाडि बढ्दछ:</p><ol><li> संवादमा "
"'<i>Qt डिजाइनरसँग सम्पादन गर्नुहोस् </i>'<li> मा क्लिक गर्नुहोस्,  '<i>विजेट</i>' चयन "
